Design basis: EQ-EAR1..EAR7 + EAR-U1 (EQS-1057, CANDIDATE). Status: DESIGNED. NOT BUILT.

## The principle (EAR2 turned into hardware)
Under the filed clock a body's split travels and its I never moves. EAR-U1 inverts the
seat law: at any chosen density, the mass that carries a chosen I is forced -
M(rho) = M_earth x exp[(I + split(rho) - 183.40029306350823) / 1.5].
A set of articles built on that curve, at densities spanning the whole shell, must ALL
read the same I on the bench. If they do, the register's core claim has been verified on
physical articles; if any one misses, the design carries its own kill.

## The planetary truth the ladder encodes
At Earth's own I (165.0810315312403), the curve passes through Earth itself:
rho 5514 -> M 5.9720e24 kg exactly. The full planetary ladder (computed EQS-1058):
500.1 -> 4.0030e24 | 1010 -> 4.5005e24 | 5514 -> 5.9720e24 (EARTH) |
12000 -> 6.7984e24 | 22604.3 -> 7.5551e24 kg - five worlds, one signature.

